  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0057_75561f380901.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 134px;\" /></p><p>Output using DeMorgan&#39;s theorem can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced></menclose><mo>&#183;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></menclose></mrow></mfenced></menclose><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced></menclose></menclose><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></menclose></menclose><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></menclose><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi>B</mi></menclose></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Which represents XOR gate.</p><p>Therefore, required truth table will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>A</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>B</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>Y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p>"
